{"id":205,"gn":"Pokémon Ver Caché","ft":["Il est prisonnier d’une coquille d’acier. Ses yeux vigilants sont la seule partie visible de son corps.","Il est totalement fixé à son arbre. Il lance des morceaux de sa carapace pour faire fuir son ennemi.","Foretress se cache dans sa carapace en acier trempé. La carapace s’ouvre quand il attrape sa proie, mais cela se passe tellement vite qu’il est impossible de voir à l’intérieur.","Il attaque tout ce qui s’approche d’un peu trop près en lançant des morceaux de sa coquille d’acier. Il n’a aucun contrôle sur ce réflexe.","On ne peut voir l’intérieur de sa carapace que lorsqu’il engloutit sa nourriture, mais il est si rapide que personne n’a encore jamais réussi."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":0,"24":1,"25":2,"26":2,"29":3,"30":4},"gr":4,"cr":75,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Insectoïde"],"gw":"medium","gm":{"sv":[0,259],"usum":[0,269],"usum*":[2,90],"hgss":[0,94],"c":[0,94],"gs":[0,94]},"f":{"205":{"n":"Foretress","t":["bug","steel"],"s":[75,90,140,60,60,40],"h":1.2,"w":125.8,"a":[[5,0],[142,1]],"pa":[[4,[[5,0]]]],"av":["sv","usum","hgss","c","gs"],"ls":[{"l":[[484,0],[393,1],[390,1],[450,1],[182,1],[192,1],[120,1],[33,1],[36,12],[229,17],[205,20],[174,23],[191,28],[371,32],[153,36],[334,42],[360,46],[38,50]],"m":[34,36,38,63,76,86,89,91,113,115,129,156,157,164,174,179,182,191,201,202,203,214,220,240,241,263,270,317,319,328,334,350,356,360,390,398,402,405,414,416,430,442,444,446,450,474,484,521,522,523,529,679,684,776,796,851,861,884,912]},{"l":[[429,0],[475,0],[429,1],[475,1],[484,1],[192,1],[393,1],[390,1],[33,1],[182,1],[120,1],[450,1],[120,6],[450,9],[36,12],[229,17],[117,20],[363,23],[191,28],[371,32],[153,36],[334,42],[360,46],[38,50],[393,56],[192,60],[484,64]],"m":[63,76,89,92,104,113,115,153,156,157,164,182,201,207,213,214,216,218,237,241,263,317,360,371,397,416,430,474,496,521,523,590],"t":[173,202,220,324,334,335,356,393,446,450,477,502,529,673]},{"l":[[390,1],[33,1],[182,1],[120,1],[450,1],[120,6],[450,9],[36,12],[229,17],